stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ProcessStopped
    ProcessStopped --> Launching: LaunchActivity after force-stop
    Launching --> InitializingPreview: activity drawn / black preview
    InitializingPreview --> IdleRear73: codec-resolution toast; camera/audio pipelines start

    IdleRear73 --> SettingsOpen: tap Settings
    SettingsOpen --> IdleRear73: navigate up / Back
    SettingsOpen --> PreferenceDraft: open editor or form
    PreferenceDraft --> SettingsOpen: Cancel / Back
    PreferenceDraft --> ValidationBlocked: required value absent
    ValidationBlocked --> PreferenceDraft: remain on form
    PreferenceDraft --> SettingsOpen: Save valid reversible setting

    IdleRear73 --> QuickSettingsOpen: tap overflow
    QuickSettingsOpen --> IdleRear73: tap overflow / Back
    QuickSettingsOpen --> QuickSettingsOpen: change tab or scroll

    IdleRear73 --> Muted: tap microphone
    Muted --> IdleRear73: tap microphone
    IdleRear73 --> Front67: tap Flip
    Front67 --> IdleRear73: tap Flip
    IdleRear73 --> Rear103: tap 103-degree lens
    Rear103 --> IdleRear73: tap 73-degree lens

    IdleRear73 --> ReloadingWebContent: tap Reload
    ReloadingWebContent --> IdleRear73: asynchronous completion; toast expires

    IdleRear73 --> NoConnectionDialog: tap Start with zero active connections
    NoConnectionDialog --> IdleRear73: Cancel / Back
    NoConnectionDialog --> NewConnectionDraft: Create connection
    NewConnectionDraft --> IdleRear73: Cancel through settings stack

    IdleRear73 --> TimestampActive: enable built-in Timestamp
    TimestampActive --> IdleRear73: disable Timestamp

    IdleRear73 --> BackgroundTask: Back or Home
    BackgroundTask --> IdleRear73: relaunch / task brought to front
    BackgroundTask --> ProcessStopped: force-stop or inactive timeout (timeout itself UNTESTED)

    note right of ProcessStopped
      Saved preferences survive force-stop.
      App data was never cleared.
    end note
    note right of BackgroundTask
      Back showed the Samsung launcher while
      the foreground-service process remained.
    end note

